# Build output goes to build/, the IDE's Publish output to publish/ — both are
# disposable. Nothing generated belongs in the project root: build with
# `-o build/app.exe` (see README "Run") rather than `-o app.exe`.
build/
publish/

# runtime state
app.db
app.db-journal
app.db-wal
uploads/
*.log
*.err
zan_crash.log

# stray artifacts, in case something was built the wrong way anyway
*.exe
*.dll
*.obj
*.o
*.lib
*.pdb
